; The largest number a period accepts still works.
;
; "every 0 months" and a period number above 65535 are now errors (see
; period-every-zero-errors.test); the range check must not reject a count
; that fits.

2024/01/01 Test
    Expenses:Food    $10.00
    Assets:Cash

test reg -p "every 65535 days" --now 2024/06/15
24-Jan-01 - 03-Jun-06  Assets:Cash                   $-10.00      $-10.00
                       Expenses:Food                  $10.00            0
end test
